algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: DeterministicVerify(A, B, K)
Input: A in R^{m x n}, B in R^{n x p}, K in R^{m x p}
Output: Boolean

for i = 0 to m-1:
    for k = 0 to p-1:
        s = sum_{j=0}^{n-1} A[i,j] * B[j,k]
        if K[i,k] != s: return false
return true

Complexity: O(m*n*p) time, O(1) space
